FuchsiaCity_Text_DidYouTrySafariGame::
    .string "Did you try\n"
    .string "the Safari Game?\p"
    .string "Rare Pokemon in there.\p"
    .string "Also something that\n"
    .string "can't be caught.\p"
    .string "Safari Balls don't\n"
    .string "work on it.\p"
    .string "Nothing works on it.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_SafariZoneZooInFront::
    .string "Eryn Vorn has\n"
    .string "a zoo out front.\p"
    .string "Safari Game out back.\p"
    .string "Something else is\n"
    .string "there after dark.\n"
    .string "Not an exhibit.\n"
    .string "Not a Pokemon.\p"
    .string "The workers call it\n"
    .string "Nullveil.\p"
    .string "They say it\n"
    .string "was there before\n"
    .string "the Eryn Vorn.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_WheresSara::
    .string "ERIK: Where's SARA?\n"
    .string "I said I'd meet\n"
    .string "her here.\p"
    .string "She went to\n"
    .string "look at the\n"
    .string "zoo at night.\p"
    .string "She saw something\n"
    .string "that wasn't in\n"
    .string "the zoo.\p"
    .string "She's been quiet since.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_ItemBallInThere::
    .string "That item ball\n"
    .string "in there.\p"
    .string "Were you wanting that?\p"
    .string "Me too.\p"
    .string "There's something else\n"
    .string "in the Eryn Vorn\n"
    .string "that nobody put there.\p"
    .string "The workers won't\n"
    .string "go near it at night.\p"
    .string "Nullveil.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_CitySign::
    .string "DORNVAEL\n"
    .string "Behold! It's Passion Pink!\p"
    .string "The nights here\n"
    .string "are less pink.\n"
    .string "More shadow.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_SafariZoneSign::
    .string "POKEMON PARADISE\n"
    .string "ERYN VORN\p"
    .string "Something in there\n"
    .string "didn't come through\n"
    .string "the entrance.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_SafariGameSign::
    .string "SAFARI GAME\n"
    .string "POKEMON-U-CATCH!\p"
    .string "Some things here\n"
    .string "cannot be caught.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_WardensHomeSign::
    .string "ERYN VORN\n"
    .string "WARDEN'S HOME\p"
    .string "The Warden stopped\n"
    .string "sleeping in the\n"
    .string "west wing.\p"
    .string "Faces the wrong\n"
    .string "way at night.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_SafariZoneOfficeSign::
    .string "POKéMON PARADISE!\n"
    .string "Welcome to the ERYN VORN!\l"
    .string "ERYN VORN OFFICE$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_GymSign::
    .string "DORNVAEL POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: KOGA\l"
    .string "The Poisonous Ninja Master$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_ChanseySign::
    .string "Name: CHANSEY\n"
    .string "Catching one is\n"
    .string "all up to chance.\p"
    .string "The Chansey here\n"
    .string "won't go near\n"
    .string "the west fence at night.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_VoltorbSign::
    .string "Name: VOLTORB\n"
    .string "The very image\n"
    .string "of a Poke Ball.\p"
    .string "This one has\n"
    .string "been discharging randomly\n"
    .string "at night.\p"
    .string "Facing nothing.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_KangaskhanSign::
    .string "Name: KANGASKHAN\n"
    .string "Maternal Pokemon.\n"
    .string "Raises young in pouch.\p"
    .string "This one holds\n"
    .string "her young very\n"
    .string "tightly after dark.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_SlowpokeSign::
    .string "Name: SLOWPOKE\n"
    .string "Friendly and very\n"
    .string "slow moving.\p"
    .string "This one stopped\n"
    .string "moving completely three\n"
    .string "nights ago.\p"
    .string "Faces west.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_LaprasSign::
    .string "Name: LAPRAS\n"
    .string "AKA king of the seas.\p"
    .string "This one won't\n"
    .string "enter the water\n"
    .string "after dark.\p"
    .string "Just stands at\n"
    .string "the edge watching.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_OmanyteSign::
    .string "Name: OMANYTE\n"
    .string "Extremely rare Pokemon\n"
    .string "regenerated from fossil.\p"
    .string "This one has\n"
    .string "been moving on\n"
    .string "its own at night.\n"
    .string "Case was locked.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_KabutoSign::
    .string "Name: KABUTO\n"
    .string "Extremely rare Pokemon\n"
    .string "regenerated from fossil.\p"
    .string "Something visited its\n"
    .string "case last week.\p"
    .string "Left no marks.\n"
    .string "Left no trace.\p"
    .string "Just darkness.$"

@ Unused. May have been meant to be the placeholder text for the zoo mons, similar to RB's "!" text
FuchsiaCity_Text_Ellipsis::
    .string "……$"

Text_SubstituteTeach::
    .string "Aww, I wish I was a KANGASKHAN\n"
    .string "baby.\p"
    .string "I'd love to be a substitute for the\n"
    .string "baby…\p"
    .string "And snuggle in the mother\n"
    .string "KANGASKHAN's belly pouch.\p"
    .string "But only POKéMON can use the\n"
    .string "technique SUBSTITUTE…\p"
    .string "Want me to teach SUBSTITUTE to\n"
    .string "one of your POKéMON?$"

Text_SubstituteDeclined::
    .string "Oh, really?\n"
    .string "SUBSTITUTE seems so fun…$"

Text_SubstituteWhichMon::
    .string "Which POKéMON wants to learn\n"
    .string "SUBSTITUTE?$"

Text_SubstituteTaught::
    .string "Boy, what I'd give to crawl inside\n"
    .string "a KANGASKHAN belly pouch…$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_MyFatherIsGymLeader::
    .string "My father is\n"
    .string "the Gym Leader here.\p"
    .string "I train with\n"
    .string "Poison Pokemon too.\p"
    .string "Father knows about\n"
    .string "Nullveil.\p"
    .string "He won't teach me\n"
    .string "that technique yet.\p"
    .string "Says I'm not ready.$"
